## Description

Anthropic released Claude Tag this week and while at first glance seems like it's just a slack bot, Karpathy disagrees - saying that it's "a new paradigm for interacting with Claude" and we focus on why that could be true with it's focus on team integrations and channel focused context/permissions.

I still hate talking about slack though...

